---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_META } from '../i18n/locales';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Topics"
  description="Overview of search visibility, GEO, AI answers, and regional approaches for Hong Kong businesses."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
        <h1>Topics</h1>
        <p>An overview of search visibility, GEO, AI answers, and regional approaches.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
        <h1>主題</h1>
        <p>搜尋可見度、GEO、AI 答案及區域做法概覽。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-content">
    <div class="container content-wide">
      <article id="seo" class="service-block">
        <span class="service-number">01</span>
        <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
          <h2>Traditional SEO</h2>
          <p>Technical audits, on-page optimization, link building, and content planning for Google and Bing rankings.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Technical audits and site health</li>
            <li>Content gaps and search intent</li>
            <li>On-page optimization and internal linking</li>
            <li>Link building and digital PR</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
          <h2>傳統 SEO 優化</h2>
          <p>技術審核、頁面優化、連結建設及內容規劃，以提升 Google 及 Bing 排名。</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>技術審核及網站健康</li>
            <li>內容差距及搜尋意圖</li>
            <li>頁面優化及內部連結</li>
            <li>連結建設及數碼公關</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article id="geo" class="service-block">
        <span class="service-number">02</span>
        <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
          <h2>Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)</h2>
          <p>Content and authority signals that may improve citation in ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>AI citation and visibility audits</li>
            <li>Structured data and schema markup</li>
            <li>E-E-A-T signal development</li>
            <li>Citation-friendly content formats</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
          <h2>生成式引擎優化 (GEO)</h2>
          <p>可能提升在 ChatGPT、Perplexity 及 Google AI Overview 中被引用的內容與權威信號。</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>AI 引用及可見度審核</li>
            <li>結構化數據及 Schema 標記</li>
            <li>E-E-A-T 信號建設</li>
            <li>易被引用的內容格式</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article id="ai-ranking" class="service-block">
        <span class="service-number">03</span>
        <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
          <h2>AI discovery</h2>
          <p>How brands may appear across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini, Copilot, and similar tools.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Prompt-based visibility tracking</li>
            <li>FAQ and knowledge base improvements</li>
            <li>Google AI Overview presence</li>
            <li>Answer-friendly content formats</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
          <h2>AI 發現</h2>
          <p>品牌可能在 ChatGPT、Perplexity、Gemini、Copilot 等工具中的呈現方式。</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>提示詞可見度追蹤</li>
            <li>FAQ 及知識庫優化</li>
            <li>Google AI Overview 呈現</li>
            <li>易被引用的內容格式</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article id="local" class="service-block">
        <span class="service-number">04</span>
        <div data-lang="en" class="lang-block is-visible">
          <h2>Hong Kong &amp; Greater Bay Area</h2>
          <p>Local listings, multilingual content, and regional context for Hong Kong and GBA markets.</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Google Business Profile and local listings</li>
            <li>Multilingual content (English and Traditional Chinese)</li>
            <li>Hreflang and regional pages</li>
            <li>Cross-border visibility planning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div data-lang="zh" class="lang-block">
          <h2>香港及大灣區</h2>
          <p>香港及大灣區市場的本地商家資料、多語言內容及區域背景。</p>
          <ul class="service-list">
            <li>Google 商家檔案及本地資料</li>
            <li>多語言內容（英語及繁體中文）</li>
            <li>Hreflang 及區域頁面</li>
            <li>跨境可見度規劃</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
